# Secrets Directory
#
# This directory contains sensitive files that should NOT be committed to Git.
#
# Required files:
# - cloudmold-git-sync.2025-12-19.private-key.pem  (GitHub App private key)
#
# Setup:
# 1. Download the private key from GitHub App settings
# 2. Place it in this directory with the exact filename above
# 3. Set permissions: chmod 0400 *.pem
#
# NEVER commit .pem files to version control!

